  "prefLabel": "Per 102.13 Bargaining unit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.13 “Bargaining unit” means a collective bargaining unit determined under RSA 273-A:8 with which the state conducts periodic negotiations through the exclusive representative of that bargaining unit certified as such by the public employee labor relations board.\n\nSource. #5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-98; renumbered by #13667 (formerly Per 102.09); renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.11), eff 12-1-25",
